IOF Control Descriptions 2024 references

Reference numbers and symbol meanings follow the International Orienteering
Federation's Specification for Control Descriptions 2024:
https://orienteering.sport/iof/rules/control-descriptions/

IOF publishes the specification under CC BY-ND 4.0. The reference PDF and
reference artwork are not included in the generated library. This project is
not an IOF-certified reproduction and does not imply IOF endorsement.

The original 38 source icons and the existing MIT LICENSE, including its
copyright notice, are preserved. The additional SVGs were imported and manually
revised from the supplied handoff proposals. This technical integration does
not establish the distribution rights for those new drawings; their provenance
must be resolved before a public release. Do not relabel IOF reference artwork
as original MIT-owned source.
